# Optional high-resolution aerial imagery for the "Aerial" background map.
# Copy to apps/web/.env.local (gitignored) and fill in ONE of the options below,
# then rebuild (pnpm demo / pnpm dev:web). Without it the app offers the plain map
# and Sentinel-2 cloudless 2016 satellite imagery, which need no key.
#
# The key is shipped to the browser: restrict it to your own domains, and check the
# provider's terms for your use (the app code is MIT, the imagery is not).

# Option 1: Esri World Imagery via ArcGIS Location Platform (free tier, needs an account).
# Create an API key with the "Basemaps" privilege at https://location.arcgis.com
# VITE_ESRI_API_KEY=

# Option 2: any XYZ raster tile template, e.g. a Norge i bilder cache your organisation
# has access to through Norge digitalt, or another WMTS in Web Mercator.
# VITE_AERIAL_TILES=https://example.org/tiles/{z}/{y}/{x}.jpg?token=...
# VITE_AERIAL_LABEL=Norge i bilder
# VITE_AERIAL_ATTRIBUTION=© Norge i bilder (Geovekst)
# VITE_AERIAL_MAXZOOM=19
# VITE_AERIAL_TILESIZE=256
